Scope

This licence covers the project's own code and artwork: the PC layer of the
game (menus, settings, input, display, audio and file handling written for
the PC), the offline bots, the custom-scenario support, the installer and its
scripts, the MA2 Scenario Editor, the build tools and the documentation.

It does not cover:
- the screenshots in docs/img, which show MechAssault 2: Lone Wolf and are
  included under Microsoft's Game Content Usage Rules (see LEGAL.md);
- MechAssault 2: Lone Wolf itself, which is not part of this repository, comes
  from the user's own disc and belongs to its rights holders;
- third-party components, which keep their own licences (files copied from
  them keep their original headers). See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Some of
  them are GPL or LGPL, so a game executable built from this source together
  with them is, as a whole, subject to those licences as well.
